Z||000000||TRiAD||06-08-2001||02:52 PM||||  <IMG SRC="http://abacus.sj.ipixmedia.com/abc/M28/121573f3e6d54ffa26660e1ea6/i-1.JPG">  <P><B>Motor Trend, March, 1988</B><BR>Motor Trend Magazine, March, 1988 is an American automobile magazine. This issue contains 134 color and black-and-white pages and features:<P>Road Test of the Ford Probe GT, including many black-and-white photos and specifications. <BR><B>Road Test of the Pontiac Fiero GT, including many black-and-white photos and specifications.</B><BR>Road Test of the BMW 325 iX 4WD, including many black-and-white photos and specifications. <BR>Driving Impressions of the Buick Riviera T-Type Turbo, including many black-and-white photos and specifications. <BR>Driving Impressions of the Bentley Eight, including many black-and-white photos and specifications. <BR>Long-Term Test of the Volkswagen GTI, including many black-and-white photos and specifications. <BR>Long-Term Test of the Chevrolet K-1500 Sportside, including many black-and-white photos and specifications. <BR>Preview of the 1988 Import Car of the Year: including details and black-and-white photos of: Audi 90 Quattro, BMW 735I, Daihatsu Charade CSX, Honda CRX Si, Honda Civic LS Sedan, Honda Prelude SI 4ws, Jaguar XJ6, Mazda MX-6 GT, Mazda 929, Pontiac LeMans GSE, Merkur Scorpio, Toyota Corolla GT-S. <BR><B>Top 10 Exoticars: Color photos and stories include: Porsche 959, Lotus Turbo Esprit, Lamborghini Miura, Lamborghini Countach, Ford GT-40, Ferrari Testarossa, Ferrari GTO, Ferrari F40, Ferrari 512 Berlinetta Boxer, BMW M1.</B><BR>Motorcycle test: Kawasaki 600R Ninja. <BR>Racing news. <BR>Many color and black-and-white ads. <BR>You'll surely enjoy the many photos and facts and figures in this magazine. It is in excellent condition, with no rips, tears or stains anywhere.<P>It'll run me $10.05 shipped. <P>Yeaaaaaaahhhhhhh!<P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg">  <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I><p>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 06-08-2001).]||||reg||6
